  S1["1. Settings, Remove the status line entry puts the<br/>previous statusLine back exactly, or removes<br/>the key.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. A settings.json Install created is deleted on<br/>Remove; when it is a link whose file Install<br/>created, the file goes and the link stays.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. Quit and move the app to the Bin.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. Moved to the Bin without Remove: the script<br/>deletes its folder's session files that stopped<br/>changing over a minute ago, so the leftover<br/>stays small.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. brew uninstall --zap runs remove.sh, which puts<br/>the previous status line back, the same way<br/>through a link (readlink -f), before the data<br/>folder goes.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. Delete Application Support and the preferences<br/>file by hand; nothing else was created.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
